<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I know not how this saving faith</l><l>To me He did impart,</l><l>Nor how believing in His word</l><l>Wrought peace within my heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I know not how the Spirit moves,</l><l>Convincing men of sin,</l><l>Revealing Jesus through the Word,</l><l>Creating faith in Him.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>I know not what of good or ill</l><l>May be reserved for me,</l><l>Of weary ways or golden days,</l><l>Before His face I see.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>I know not when my Lord may come,</l><l>At night or noon-day fair,</l><l>Nor if I’ll walk the vale with Him,</l><l>Or “meet Him in the air.”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
